{"id":"msg_m_ex_flora_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_flora","label":"Flora · Nikke"},"label":"2. Blossom,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_flora_01","next":"msg_m_ex_flora_03","speakers":{"flora":"Flora"},"icons":{"flora":"si_c411_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_1","text":"Blossom,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_2","text":"are you busy today?✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_3","text":"No, I'm free.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_4","text":"Would it be all right to visit you in the Commander's Room?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_5","text":"I need something for the garden,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_6","text":"and since I haven't been out in a while,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_7","text":"it feels a bit of a waste to go straight back to the garden.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_8","text":"Of course, come by anytime.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_9","text":"Thank you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_10","text":"I saw many people who reminded me of flowers today, and it made me very happy.✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_11","text":"I saw someone who looked like a daisy,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_12","text":"another who resembled a cosmos,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_13","text":"and another who was the spitting image of a primrose.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_14","text":"Which flower do I resemble?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_15","text":"You, Blossom?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_16","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_17","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_17","text":"Flora doesn't respond for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_18","text":"Do I not resemble any flower?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_19","text":"Oh no,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_20","text":"that's not it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_21","text":"It's that there are too many flowers that you're reminiscent of.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_22","text":"It's quite difficult to choose just one.✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_23","text":"Still, I'd really like for you to choose one for me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_24","text":"All right then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_25","text":"In that case, I would choose the buttercup.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_26","text":"Why that one?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_27","text":"Buttercups have a vibrant appearance,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_28","text":"just like you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_29","text":"but more than that, I find their symbolism to be a perfect match for you.✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_30","text":"What does it mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_31","text":"Charm.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_32","text":"And you are","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_33","text":"the most charming person I know.✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_34","text":"May I also tell you of a flower that reminds me of you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_35","text":"A flower that resembles me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_36","text":"Come to think of it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_37","text":"no one has ever told me which flower resembles me.✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_38","text":"So, what kind of flower do you think I resemble,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_39","text":"Blossom?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_40","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_40","text":"Lavender.","jump":"m_ex_flora_02_42"},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_41","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_41","text":"Iris.","jump":"m_ex_flora_02_42"},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_42","text":"How so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_43","text":"Because they're beautiful.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_44","text":"Really?✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_45","text":"That is one of my favorite flowers.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_46","text":"The color suits me wonderfully.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_47","text":"If that flower reminds you of me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_48","text":"then I'll grow some in the garden and give them to you as a gift.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_49","text":"That way, you'll think of me more often.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_50","text":"That'd be wonderful.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_51","text":"I'll be at the Commander's Room soon.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_52","text":"See you in a few minutes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_53","text":"See you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_flora_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_flora_02_54","text":"@}>->----","jump":null}],"chat":true}